  "content": "<h2>备注</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如果模组无法启动，请尝试使用最新版本的 Forge。</li>\n<li>游戏内的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAdvancement\" rel=\"nofollow\">进度 GUI</a> 中提供了操作该模组的说明。</li>\n<li>按住 Shift 并交互可以拾取和旋转 Fumo。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<p>[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252freimu-fumo-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">盗版博丽灵梦</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkirisame-marisa-5716667%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">雾雨魔理沙</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fshiki-eiki-yamazanadu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">射命丸文</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fcirno-5702116%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">琪露诺</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252ftanned-cirno%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">晒黑的琪露诺</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fchen-touhou-project-5282531%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">陈</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252freimu-5448033%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">博丽灵梦</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkomeiji-koishi-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">古明地觉</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fflandre-scarlet-touhou-project-5320723%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">芙兰朵露·斯卡雷特</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">红美铃</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkonpaku-youmu-touhou-project-5812902%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">魂魄妖梦</a>]\n[幽幽子=<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">红美铃</a>+<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fpatchouli-knowledge-touhou-project-5564037%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">帕秋莉</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fpatchouli-knowledge-touhou-project-5564037%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">帕秋莉</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fnitori-kawashiro-5940728%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">河城荷取</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252ftewi-inaba-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">因幡帝</a>]\n[娜兹玲=<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">红美铃</a>+<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fnazrin-touhou-project-anime-game%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">娜兹玲</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fsunny-milk-5837094%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">苏菲·斯塔列特</a>]</p>",
